  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Demonic Gu Masters cheer him as Lord Wu Gui when dark clouds cover San Cha Mountain. Talk places him as over hundreds of years old and ties his hatred of Tie Mu Bai to a ruined rank six breakthrough; he had slaughtered Tie clansmen many times as revenge.",
      "chapters": [
        372
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_demonic_path",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_tie_mu_bai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He fights Tie Mu Bai from the clouds, then Ku Mo joins and the clash becomes two demonic rank five peak stage Gu Masters against one. Spectators see him step on a dark cloud with lips like a black beak. His pitch black Gu spreads darkness that restricts Gu worms under rank six to different degrees.",
      "chapters": [
        373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ku_mo",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "gu_pitch_black_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He steps on a dark cloud. His lips stick sharply forward like a black beak.",
      "chapters": [
        373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the inheritance he manipulates chrysanthemum akita dogs against a larger lightning symbol dog pack. He had become an enslavement path Gu Master many years earlier and later changed paths from a lack of resources. Fang Yuan appears behind him while he concentrates on the dog battle and kills him with a bone spike through the heart. Fang Yuan takes his Gu, including one rank five pitch black Gu, and feeds his aperture to beast strength placenta Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        380
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inside-the-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_beast_strength_placenta_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later groups him with Tie Mu Bai and Ku Mo as rank five peak stage among the five rank five Gu Masters on San Cha mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        381
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-peak-grouping",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Shen Tong later names him as a rank five Gu Master who once walked enslavement path and had to change paths midway for resources.",
      "chapters": [
        386
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "former-enslavement-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shen_tong"
      ]
    }
  ],
